<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24636" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intrō-spĭcĭo</span></b> ,
			spexi, spectum, 3, v. a.
		specio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to look into</i>, <i>look at</i>
			(syn. inspicio). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>To look into</i> any thing: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">domum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Har. Resp. 15, 1, 33</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">casas omnium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Div. 2, 51, 105</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>To look at</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliorum felicitatem aegris oculis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					2, 20</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to inspect</i>, <i>examine</i>, <i>observe
			attentively;</i> constr. with <i>in</i> and
				acc., or simple acc.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> With <i>in</i> and <i>acc.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">introspicite penitus in omnes rei publicae
					partes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Font. 15, 43</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in mentem tuam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Fin. 2, 35, 118</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			With simple <i>acc.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">penitus introspicite Catilinae, Cethegi,
					ceterorumque mentes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Sull. 27, 76</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fortunam suam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac.
					A. 11, 38</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">numinum religiones,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 60</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">non introspectis penitus virtutibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 10, 2, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Pan. 75</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">verba,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					17, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
